17:Te37,[{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Service","name":"Roadside tire repair in Surrey BC","serviceType":"roadside tire repair","provider":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Canada Tire Repair & Roadside","telephone":"+1888XXXXXXX","url":"https://canadatirerepair.com/"},"areaServed":"Surrey BC","url":"https://canadatirerepair.com/roadside-tire-repair-surrey-bc","description":"Shoulder width, gravel, and traffic speed all affect how we stage the truck. You are booking roadside tire repair in Surrey BC—crews know local parking bylaws and after-hours access for yards. Surrey BC (620k city) mixes high-footfall strips such as Whalley storefronts and South Surrey strip malls with landmark retail near City Centre SkyTrain hub. Local climate note for Surrey BC: Coastal moisture swells door frames if sealant is aged. If the break is on a axle with lug torque spec, mention it—we bring torque sticks when needed. Dial 1-888-XXX-XXXX for a clear timeline on security, measurement, and install."},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://canadatirerepair.com/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Cities","item":"https://canadatirerepair.com/locations"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"Roadside tire repair Surrey BC","item":"https://canadatirerepair.com/roadside-tire-repair-surrey-bc"}]},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Is roadside tire repair in Surrey BC priced per tire or per wheel well?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We do not publish one national price because axle hardware and rated thickness vary. 1-888-XXX-XXXX outlines typical costs for Surrey BC."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How soon can you do roadside tire repair in Surrey BC?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Board-up can often happen the same night; custom tire depends on supplier lead times. Share urgency when you d